{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-explainer-about-bomberman-what-the-game-is-maze-action-place-bombs-soft-blocks-power-up/audio/main-4c9dd7f0156e.mp3","durationSec":188.304,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.72,"text":"Bomberman is a series of maze and action games."},{"start":3.44,"end":5.42,"text":"A maze is a place with paths and walls."},{"start":6.12,"end":8.74,"text":"You move your character along the paths and put down bombs."},{"start":9.52,"end":12.92,"text":"The bombs break soft blocks, which are blocks you can destroy."},{"start":13.8,"end":15.46,"text":"This opens more space to move."},{"start":16.22,"end":19.82,"text":"You can also find a power-up, an item that gives you extra help."},{"start":20.46,"end":22.78,"text":"For example, it can make your bombs stronger."},{"start":23.4,"end":25.84,"text":"But stronger bombs can be dangerous for you, too."},{"start":26.58,"end":28.2,"text":"Your own blast can catch you."},{"start":28.74,"end":32.74,"text":"The simple idea is to place a bomb, move away, and stay safe."},{"start":33.34,"end":36.22,"text":"The maze is a grid, with spaces in rows and columns."},{"start":36.94,"end":39.34,"text":"You move through the open spaces and drop a bomb."},{"start":40,"end":45.28,"text":"The bomb pulses for a short time, then sends flames left, right, up, and down."},{"start":46.18,"end":47.88,"text":"The flames do not travel in a circle."},{"start":48.66,"end":50.12,"text":"Soft walls can break in the blast."},{"start":50.88,"end":53.1,"text":"Items may appear, and you can pick them up."},{"start":53.72,"end":55.7,"text":"Some power-ups let you place more bombs."},{"start":55.7,"end":58.02,"text":"Others make the flames reach farther."},{"start":58.76,"end":61.04,"text":"One bomb can also set off another bomb."},{"start":61.78,"end":63.06,"text":"This is a chain reaction."},{"start":63.84,"end":68.2,"text":"Watch the paths before you move, not just the space beside you."},{"start":69.06,"end":73,"text":"Hudson Soft was a Japanese video game company that created the series."},{"start":73.64,"end":77.82,"text":"The first game was called Bomber Man and came out in July 1983."},{"start":79.06,"end":85.16,"text":"Another name for that first game was Bakudan Otoko, meaning “Bomb-Man.”"},{"start":85.16,"end":90.86,"text":"Bomberman came to the Nintendo Entertainment System, or NES, in 1985."},{"start":92.32,"end":96.4,"text":"People often mean this early home version when they talk about the original classic."},{"start":96.96,"end":101.1,"text":"So the first release and the familiar early home game have different dates."},{"start":102.16,"end":104.28,"text":"The series continued for many years."},{"start":104.28,"end":112.26,"text":"Multiplayer, which means playing with other people, became a key part from the TurboGrafx-16 game in 1990 onward."},{"start":112.26,"end":114.98,"text":"Super Bomberman came out in 1993."},{"start":114.98,"end":119.3,"text":"It was a game for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System, or SNES."},{"start":120,"end":123.58,"text":"Players often remember it as a home multiplayer classic in the series."},{"start":124.28,"end":127.26,"text":"Its Battle Mode allows up to four players to play together."},{"start":127.9,"end":132.62,"text":"More than two human players need a multitap, a device that connects extra controllers."},{"start":133.46,"end":138.68,"text":"Players move around a maze with soft blocks, collect power-ups, and try to catch each other with bombs."},{"start":139.48,"end":142.72,"text":"Opening a path can help you, but it can help another player, too."},{"start":143.34,"end":147.88,"text":"This mix of simple rules and shared danger makes it famous for party play."},{"start":148.94,"end":154.04,"text":"Bomberman ’94 is another well-known game in the series, released in 1993."},{"start":155.06,"end":158,"text":"Mega Bomberman is the name used for its release elsewhere."},{"start":158.78,"end":163.02,"text":"There are many versions, so the name of the series does not mean just one game."},{"start":163.6,"end":169.9,"text":"Super Bomberman remains the famous home multiplayer classic that people often mean when they remember playing with friends."},{"start":170.42,"end":178.42,"text":"The familiar ideas are easy to recognise: a maze, soft blocks, bombs, and power-ups."},{"start":178.42,"end":183.62,"text":"Hudson Soft later became part of another company after its acquisition in 2011."},{"start":183.62,"end":187.74,"text":"Konami is that company and became the owner of the series."}],"words":[{"text":"Bomberman","start":0,"end":0.4},{"text":"is","start":0.4,"end":0.76},{"text":"a","start":0.76,"end":0.98},{"text":"series","start":0.98,"end":1.16},{"text":"of","start":1.16,"end":1.52},{"text":"maze","start":1.52,"end":1.74},{"text":"and","start":1.74,"end":1.98},{"text":"action","start":1.98,"end":2.28},{"text":"games","start":2.28,"end":2.72},{"text":"A","start":3.44,"end":3.48},{"text":"maze","start":3.48,"end":3.74},{"text":"is","start":3.74,"end":3.94},{"text":"a","start":3.94,"end":4.1},{"text":"place","start":4.1,"end":4.32},{"text":"with","start":4.32,"end":4.64},{"text":"paths","start":4.64,"end":4.92},{"text":"and","start":4.92,"end":5.14},{"text":"walls","start":5.14,"end":5.42},{"text":"You","start":6.12,"end":6.26},{"text":"move","start":6.26,"end":6.44},{"text":"your","start":6.44,"end":6.62},{"text":"character","start":6.62,"end":6.96},{"text":"along","start":6.96,"end":7.26},{"text":"the","start":7.26,"end":7.44},{"text":"paths","start":7.44,"end":7.74},{"text":"and","start":7.74,"end":7.98},{"text":"put","start":7.98,"end":8.14},{"text":"down","start":8.14,"end":8.4},{"text":"bombs","start":8.4,"end":8.74},{"text":"The","start":9.52,"end":9.68},{"text":"bombs","start":9.68,"end":10.02},{"text":"break","start":10.02,"end":10.38},{"text":"soft","start":10.38,"end":10.78},{"text":"blocks","start":10.78,"end":11.18},{"text":"which","start":11.62,"end":11.8},{"text":"are